---
<BaseLayout title="Income Tax Calculator — India FY 2024-25 Estimate" description={description} canonical="https://deskutil.com/finance/income-tax-calculator/" jsonLd={jsonLd}>
<div class="shell breadcrumbs"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/finance/">Finance</a></li><li aria-current="page">Income Tax Calculator</li></ol></nav></div>
<section class="shell page-heading tool-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Finance tool</p><h1>Income Tax Calculator</h1><p>Estimate India income tax for a resident individual under 60 for FY 2024-25 (AY 2025-26). Choose the new or old regime, enter gross annual income and optional deductions, then see taxable income, tax, cess, and total liability—all in your browser.</p>
<div class="tool-panel"><div class="tool-topbar" role="toolbar" aria-label="Income tax actions"><button class="tool-button primary" id="calculate" type="button">Calculate</button><button class="tool-button" id="copy" type="button">Copy results</button><span class="privacy-note">Processed only in your browser</span></div>
<div class="tool-fields">
<div class="tool-field grow"><label for="gross-income">Gross annual income (₹)</label><input class="field-input" id="gross-income" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="e.g. 1200000" /></div>
<div class="tool-field grow"><label for="deductions">Other deductions (₹, optional)</label><input class="field-input" id="deductions" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="e.g. 80C / HRA under old regime" value="0" /></div>
<div class="tool-field grow"><span>Tax regime</span><div class="tool-checks"><label class="tool-check"><input type="radio" name="regime" value="new" checked /> New regime (default)</label><label class="tool-check"><input type="radio" name="regime" value="old" /> Old regime</label></div></div>
</div>
<div class="tool-output prose-output" id="tax-results">
<div class="finance-grid">
<div class="finance-stat"><span>Taxable income</span><strong id="out-taxable">—</strong></div>
<div class="finance-stat"><span>Tax before cess</span><strong id="out-tax">—</strong></div>
<div class="finance-stat"><span>Rebate (87A)</span><strong id="out-rebate">—</strong></div>
<div class="finance-stat"><span>Cess (4%)</span><strong id="out-cess">—</strong></div>
<div class="finance-stat"><span>Total tax</span><strong id="out-total">—</strong></div>
<div class="finance-stat"><span>Effective rate</span><strong id="out-effective">—</strong></div>
<div class="finance-stat"><span>Standard deduction</span><strong id="out-standard">—</strong></div>
<div class="finance-stat"><span>Regime</span><strong id="out-regime">—</strong></div>
</div>
</div>
<p class="status" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Enter gross income and regime, then calculate.</p></div>
<div class="content-grid"><article class="prose"><h2>How to use the income tax calculator</h2><p>Enter your gross annual income, pick the <strong>new</strong> or <strong>old</strong> regime, and add optional chapter VI-A or other deductions if they apply (often used under the old regime). Choose <strong>Calculate</strong> to see taxable income, tax before cess, section 87A rebate, 4% cess, total tax, and effective rate on gross income. Use <strong>Copy results</strong> when you want the breakdown elsewhere. Nothing is uploaded. Figures assume a resident individual under 60 and ignore surcharge on very high incomes.</p>
<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
<h3>Which financial year does this income tax calculator use?</h3><p>FY 2024-25 (AY 2025-26). The new regime uses Budget 2024 slabs with a ₹75,000 standard deduction and section 87A rebate when taxable income is up to ₹7 lakh. The old regime uses classic slabs with a ₹50,000 standard deduction and rebate when taxable income is up to ₹5 lakh. Health and education cess is 4% on tax after rebate.</p>
<h3>How is taxable income calculated?</h3><p>Gross annual income minus the regime’s standard deduction, minus optional deductions you enter. Results below zero become zero. Under the new regime many chapter VI-A deductions are unavailable, so leave other deductions at zero unless you know an allowed amount applies.</p>
<h3>How does the section 87A rebate work here?</h3><p>New regime: taxable income up to ₹7 lakh gets a rebate that clears tax before cess. Old regime: taxable income up to ₹5 lakh gets the same treatment. Cess is calculated on tax after rebate.</p>
<h3>Is this official income tax advice?</h3><p>No. Results are planning estimates only. Surcharge, alternate deductions, senior-citizen slabs, and other edge cases are simplified or omitted. This page is not Income Tax Department advice and not financial advice.</p>
<h3>Does the income tax calculator upload my income details?</h3><p>No. Tax math runs in your browser. Deskutil never receives the income, regime, deductions, or other figures you enter.</p></article>
<aside class="aside-card"><h2>Explore Deskutil</h2><ul><li><a href="/finance/">Finance tools</a></li><li><a href="/finance/compound-interest-calculator/">Compound Interest Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/finance/fd-calculator/">FD Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/finance/sip-calculator/">SIP Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/finance/emi-calculator/">EMI Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/finance/gst-calculator/">GST Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/">All live tools</a></li><li><a href="/privacy/">How privacy works</a></li><li><a href="/about/">About Deskutil</a></li><li><a href="/contact/">Contact</a></li></ul></aside></div></section>
<script>
const incomeInput=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#gross-income')!;
const deductionsInput=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#deductions')!;
const status=document.querySelector<HTMLParagraphElement>('#status')!;
const out={taxable:document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#out-taxable')!,tax:document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#out-tax')!,rebate:document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#out-rebate')!,cess:document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#out-cess')!,total:document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#out-total')!,effective:document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#out-effective')!,standard:document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#out-standard')!,regime:document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#out-regime')!};
let lastCopy='';
const setStatus=(message:string,kind='')=>{status.textContent=message;status.className=`status ${kind}`.trim()};
const round2=(n:number)=>Math.round(n*100)/100;
const rupee=(n:number)=>n.toLocaleString('en-IN',{minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2});
const selected=(name:string)=>document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`input[name="${name}"]:checked`)?.value??'';
const parseIncome=()=>{
  const raw=incomeInput.value.trim().replace(/,/g,'');
  if(!raw)throw new Error('Enter gross annual income.');
  const amount=Number(raw);
  if(!Number.isFinite(amount)||amount<0)throw new Error('Enter gross income of 0 or more.');
  if(amount>1e12)throw new Error('Enter a realistic gross income.');
  return amount;
};
const parseDeductions=()=>{
  const raw=deductionsInput.value.trim().replace(/,/g,'');
  if(!raw)return 0;
  const amount=Number(raw);
  if(!Number.isFinite(amount)||amount<0)throw new Error('Enter deductions of 0 or more.');
  return amount;
};
type Slab={upto:number;rate:number};
const taxFromSlabs=(taxable:number,slabs:Slab[])=>{
  let remaining=taxable;
  let prev=0;
  let tax=0;
  for(const slab of slabs){
    const width=slab.upto===Infinity?remaining:Math.max(0,Math.min(remaining,slab.upto-prev));
    tax+=width*(slab.rate/100);
    remaining-=width;
    prev=slab.upto===Infinity?prev:slab.upto;
    if(remaining<=0)break;
  }
  return tax;
};
const calculate=()=>{
  const gross=parseIncome();
  const other=parseDeductions();
  const regime=selected('regime');
  if(regime!=='new'&&regime!=='old')throw new Error('Choose a tax regime.');
  const standard=regime==='new'?75000:50000;
  const rebateLimit=regime==='new'?700000:500000;
  const slabs:Slab[]=regime==='new'
    ?[{upto:300000,rate:0},{upto:700000,rate:5},{upto:1000000,rate:10},{upto:1200000,rate:15},{upto:1500000,rate:20},{upto:Infinity,rate:30}]
    :[{upto:250000,rate:0},{upto:500000,rate:5},{upto:1000000,rate:20},{upto:Infinity,rate:30}];
  const taxable=Math.max(0,round2(gross-standard-other));
  let taxBeforeRebate=round2(taxFromSlabs(taxable,slabs));
  let rebate=0;
  if(taxable<=rebateLimit)rebate=taxBeforeRebate;
  const taxAfterRebate=round2(Math.max(0,taxBeforeRebate-rebate));
  const cess=round2(taxAfterRebate*0.04);
  const total=round2(taxAfterRebate+cess);
  const effective=gross>0?round2((total/gross)*100):0;
  const regimeLabel=regime==='new'?'New regime':'Old regime';
  out.taxable.textContent=rupee(taxable);
  out.tax.textContent=rupee(taxAfterRebate);
  out.rebate.textContent=rupee(rebate);
  out.cess.textContent=rupee(cess);
  out.total.textContent=rupee(total);
  out.effective.textContent=`${effective}%`;
  out.standard.textContent=rupee(standard);
  out.regime.textContent=regimeLabel;
  lastCopy=['Income tax breakdown (FY 2024-25 / AY 2025-26)',`Regime: ${regimeLabel}`,`Gross annual income: ${rupee(gross)}`,`Standard deduction: ${rupee(standard)}`,`Other deductions: ${rupee(other)}`,`Taxable income: ${rupee(taxable)}`,`Tax before rebate: ${rupee(taxBeforeRebate)}`,`Rebate u/s 87A: ${rupee(rebate)}`,`Tax after rebate: ${rupee(taxAfterRebate)}`,`Cess (4%): ${rupee(cess)}`,`Total tax: ${rupee(total)}`,`Effective rate on gross: ${effective}%`].join('\n');
  return `Total tax is ${rupee(total)}.`;
};
document.querySelector('#calculate')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{try{setStatus(calculate(),'success')}catch(error){setStatus(error instanceof Error?error.message:'Could not calculate income tax.','error')}});
document.querySelector('#copy')?.addEventListener('click',async()=>{try{if(!lastCopy)throw new Error('Calculate first.');await navigator.clipboard.writeText(lastCopy);setStatus('Copied income tax results.','success')}catch(error){setStatus(error instanceof Error?error.message:'Could not copy.','error')}});
for(const input of [incomeInput,deductionsInput])input.addEventListener('keydown',(event)=>{if(event.key==='Enter'){event.preventDefault();try{setStatus(calculate(),'success')}catch(error){setStatus(error instanceof Error?error.message:'Could not calculate income tax.','error')}}});
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="regime"]').forEach((input)=>input.addEventListener('change',()=>{try{if(incomeInput.value.trim())setStatus(calculate(),'success')}catch(error){setStatus(error instanceof Error?error.message:'Could not calculate income tax.','error')}}));
</script></BaseLayout>
